                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "Juuled"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "6f5bf784-4915-4581-acbf-74dfd5a73345",
                        "entry_id": "88ed0de9-80fc-3672-9b8d-d7034e91e1fa",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "Juuled"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "62541f89-3f4c-3e1d-a2c6-a44ebd99a653",
                        "entry_id": "88ed0de9-80fc-3672-9b8d-d7034e91e1fa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To smoke a Juul."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "616d0a87-d369-4ac9-bc0f-af7056685f9f",
                                "sense_id": "62541f89-3f4c-3e1d-a2c6-a44ebd99a653",
                                "text": "Just this week, while taking a history from a 19-year-old young man, I asked him if he smoked cigarettes. The answer was no. I then asked him if he vaped. He answered that he used a Juul. When asked how many times a day, he replied that he Juuled continuously, all day."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35ce96c5-8265-40df-9dab-3ff85403fe75",
                                "sense_id": "62541f89-3f4c-3e1d-a2c6-a44ebd99a653",
                                "text": "I took my tween to a concert last month at the state fair in Minnesota, and we were possibly the only two people in the crowd near the stage who weren't Juuling."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc22f211-ad68-4a4c-826d-7962023643f9",
                                "sense_id": "62541f89-3f4c-3e1d-a2c6-a44ebd99a653",
                                "text": "When I Juuled, I didn't take smoke breaks – I had grown accustomed to puffing away all day at my desk, and even more on stressful deadlines."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad63b044-945e-4807-8590-50fb4b8a5b9a",
                                "sense_id": "62541f89-3f4c-3e1d-a2c6-a44ebd99a653",
                                "text": "His life: […] He [Antoni Porowski] knows he shouldn't, but he Juuls (mint, in case you were wondering)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a6916b1-e8d4-40b2-b830-ba0edef9c5a8",
                                "sense_id": "62541f89-3f4c-3e1d-a2c6-a44ebd99a653",
                                "text": "That is the most important change over the last couple weeks for me... Do you vape? Do you Juul? Very bluntly. It's part of what I ask now."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0734fc82-b2e9-4019-ab0f-0eefd7a2c1df",
                                "sense_id": "62541f89-3f4c-3e1d-a2c6-a44ebd99a653",
                                "text": "Perhaps the most fascinating, and darkly comedic, anecdote in \"The Devil's Playbook\" comes when Juul meets some of its fiercest critics: several wealthy California financiers who become incensed when they learn that their own kids and their kids' friends are Juuling."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
